# Mintt Studio

> Shopify apps for shoppable Instagram feeds, TikTok storefront video, free gifts with purchase, and Shop discovery. Official marketing site at minttstudio.com.

Mintt Studio builds storefront widgets and commerce apps used by Shopify merchants worldwide. Product detail is distributed across product pages below; Shopify App Store installs use the canonical app URLs listed under Apps.

## Essential pages

- [Home](https://minttstudio.com/): Marketing homepage: Instagram feed widgets, social proof, and Shopify positioning.
- [Mintt Instafeed](https://minttstudio.com/instafeed-instagram-feed): Main Instagram / shoppable video feed product page.
- [Pricing](https://minttstudio.com/pricing): Instafeed pricing tiers for Shopify stores.
- [About](https://minttstudio.com/about): Company overview.
- [Contact](https://minttstudio.com/contact): Contact Mintt Studio.

## Apps (Shopify App Store)

- [Mintt Instafeed on Shopify](https://apps.shopify.com/instafeed?surface_detail=mintt-studio-website): Install Instafeed from the Shopify App Store.
- [Mintt Free Gift on Shopify](https://apps.shopify.com/mintt-free-gift?surface_detail=mintt-studio-website): Free gift with qualifying orders. App Store listing.

